        "TileImage": "$($repository 967f26c6-f862-449d-a873-a068c176dd3b).Image",
        "Description": "We have identified Templars who want to sabotage the work of our Assassins. Jay Huntley is a powerful figure who oversees the bank&apos;s top security. Bertram Tellez is his right-hand man, keeping an eye on the entrance. Pasty Monaghan assists him with spying.\rTheir weak point is Jimmie Gladwin. He has gone undercover as an investment banker and is supposed to sabotage the stock market. But his nerves can&apos;t take it, which is why he regularly takes drugs. Maybe this is your chance, 47.",
